     "titulo": "B2 in context",
     "texto": [
      "The participle **-DIK** lets you describe a work: **ışığın düştüğü alan** («the area where the light falls»). It distinguishes description, interpretation and evaluation.",
      "Separate what you see in the painting from the interpretation you propose."
